<title>JAPAN: Mitsumi ask-only after ratings cut.</title>
<headline>Mitsumi ask-only after ratings cut.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsumi Electric Co Ltd was ask-only in early Thursday morning trade after a major brokerage cut its rating, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0024 GMT, the shares were ask-only at 2,840 yen after closing at 2,920 yen on the previous day.</p>
